{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Dm]Be strong in the [C]Lord and in his [Dm]might
Put on the full [C]armor of [F]God
[Gm]Stand against the [Dm]schemes of the devil
[Bb]Not against [C]flesh and blood we [Dm]go
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
